sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer (tenant-alpha)
    participant Gateway as API Gateway (:8080)
    participant TicketSvc as Ticket Service (:8081)
    participant Outbox as Outbox Poller
    participant Kafka as Apache Kafka (:9092)
    participant AIPlane as AI Supervisor Loop (:8000)
    participant Knowledge as Knowledge Service (:8082)
    participant Workflow as Workflow Service (:8083)
    actor Manager as Support Manager (tenant-alpha)
    participant Usage as Usage & Audit Service (:8085)

    Customer->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/tickets ("Empty package received, refund required")
    Gateway->>TicketSvc: Forward with JWT & X-Tenant-Id: tenant-alpha
    TicketSvc->>TicketSvc: Persist Ticket (Status: NEW) + Outbox record (ticket.created.v1)
    TicketSvc-->>Customer: HTTP 201 Created (Ticket ID: e757ab5c)

    Outbox->>Kafka: Poll Outbox & Publish ticket.created.v1 (Key: tenant-alpha)
    Kafka->>AIPlane: Deliver event to AI Consumer

    Note over AIPlane: Stage 1: Triage Agent
    AIPlane->>AIPlane: Classifies: RETURN_REFUND, is_financial=true, requires_human_approval=true

    Note over AIPlane: Stage 2: Retrieval Agent
    AIPlane->>Knowledge: POST /api/v1/knowledge/search ("Empty package refund policy")
    Knowledge-->>AIPlane: Chunks with Citation [Doc: "Refund Policy" v1 #chunk-0]

    Note over AIPlane: Stage 3: Resolution & Critic Agents
    AIPlane->>AIPlane: Drafts response & validates grounding against policy terms

    Note over AIPlane: Stage 4: Human-in-the-Loop Routing
    AIPlane->>Workflow: POST /api/v1/approvals (actionType="REFUND_APPROVAL", ticketId=e757ab5c)
    Workflow-->>AIPlane: Created Approval (ID: 41cbcec6, Status: PENDING)

    AIPlane->>TicketSvc: Add INTERNAL comment ("Flagged for manager refund review")
    AIPlane->>TicketSvc: Add PUBLIC comment ("Your refund request is queued for manager review")
    AIPlane->>TicketSvc: PATCH /status -> PENDING ("Awaiting human approval")

    Note over Manager: Stage 5: Human Review via Admin Console
    Manager->>Workflow: GET /api/v1/approvals/pending
    Workflow-->>Manager: Returns Approval 41cbcec6
    Manager->>Workflow: POST /api/v1/approvals/41cbcec6/decision (decision=APPROVED, note="Package confirmed lost")
    Workflow-->>Manager: HTTP 200 OK (Status: APPROVED)
    Workflow->>Kafka: Publish workflow.approval.granted.v1

    Note over AIPlane: Stage 6: Execution & Finalization
    Kafka->>AIPlane: Consume approval granted
    AIPlane->>TicketSvc: PATCH /status -> RESOLVED ("Refund authorized and processed")
    AIPlane->>TicketSvc: Add PUBLIC comment ("Refund of $120.00 successfully issued to your card.")
    AIPlane->>Usage: POST /api/v1/usage (tokens=350, model="llama3:8b", latency=125ms)
    AIPlane->>Usage: POST /api/v1/audit (event="TICKET_RESOLVED_WITH_APPROVAL")
